Package: dough-calculator
Version: 6.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk
Installed-Size: 144
Maintainer: Dough Calculator <xaviermcom9@gmail.com>
Description: Pizza dough calculator
 Dial in pizza size, quantity and thickness (optionally gluten-free) and
 get exact ingredient weights, instructions and bake notes.
 Run "dough-calculator --cli --help" for the command-line mode.
